          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo nami wold'abe, qaaloleeni, seera kiyya gula, dubbi worra qoru malte. Worri aadaafi seera kiyya gula jila tiyya tolfachu male, ammalle guyya Sabato ch'ufa qulqullo tolchu male.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
