              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Waan anini gosa Israeliti d'aalaa kenne keesaa qaaloleeni qooda ufi ka huji qaalluma qabdi. Worri qooda lafa Israeli keesa qabaachu himmalle, wonti akanatiifi qoodi worraa anuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
