              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.8+NUM.18.9+NUM.18.10+NUM.18.11+NUM.18.12+NUM.18.13+NUM.18.14+NUM.18.15+NUM.18.16+NUM.18.17+NUM.18.18+NUM.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 18.8-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mid'aani Waaqaa baasanifi sorio dabaani ufi ira baasanifi horini gati sorio baasanileeni ha sagale qaalole tahuti; ammalle waan Israeli keesa naa olkayani ch'ufa worraa kennu malani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaaloleeni waan oobruuni qaraa baaftu dadansaafi waan naa baasani d'ibile ch'ufa fud'achu malte. Biyyiti hojja qit'a d'aabdu ch'ufa qit'a qara d'aabad'u ha qaalole kennitu, aka akasiini eeba tiyya argattu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
